    "commit_body": "Ship variant A from A/B sim: removing the MC gradient improves WR15 by\n+2.9pp @ 85+, +2.6pp @ 90+, +5.0pp @ 95+ on 5y window (the strategy's\nrelevant metric for 30DTE hard-sell-day-15). Gradient was delaying signal\nconviction buildup on high-tier setups without a win-rate payoff.\n\nAlso: recalculate_scores_batched now falls back to the most recent volume\nsignals across ANY version when the current version has no prior rows, so\na newly shipped algorithm version doesn't lose volume decay context at\nthe slice boundary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
